# The template dialog and its compiled stores defeat diff review: one huge md cell (or one
# jsonl record) per line, whose rebuilds scatter changes - nbdime's driver hangs on the
# dialog (quadratic inline diff), and regenerated rounds aren't reviewable as diffs anyway.
# Hide them by default; `git diff --text` forces a look.
llmdojo/dojo_data/*template*.ipynb -diff
llmdojo/dojo_data/*_store/** -diff
